==Battleground==
*5 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*20 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*7 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Zapy|Zapies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Pure Gold R.Ost]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*6 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Pure Gold R.Ost]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Pure Gold R.Ost]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Note that the Pure Gold R.Ost here only has 60 hp, so a dedicated critter isn't needed for them, all you need in terms of [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metals]] is something that can deal with the other peons, for example [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] works well here. You shouldn't worry about Pure Gold R.Ost's damage as it is pretty low. [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] also handles them with relative ease.

Better dedicate your units to dealing with zombies as they are the main threat. Some common options include: [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] and [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Island Cat]].

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Agent Staal (Uber Rare Cat)|Agent Staal]]: Having Strong and Slow VS Zombie and Metals enemies, Staal was practically made for this stage. He also outranges every enemy on this stage while Slowing them to a crawl.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: Luna is great against the Zombies here, being Strong Against them and being able to Freeze. Just be sure to bring dedicated anti-Metal units, as she can't do anything against them.

